<h3>Numerical Results 2</h3>
<pre class=3D"r"><code class=3D"hljs">cor(SIMS~GRIP, data=3Ddata)</code></p=
re>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs">## [1] 0.64</code></pre>
<p>The correlation between SIMS and ARM is greater than SIMS and GRIP.
